      "comment": "Silverwing: Lan Junming, the Wind Reader",
      "content": "Lan Junming is a member of the Eight Adepts known as the Wind Reader. In the Archon War he created a ward against evil spirits using his Qimen Arts and principles of Wuwang Kid's Qihuang Arts. Silverwing carried sigils with the ward and the two met every year to renew it. His remnant soul, held by a Soul-Binding Art, woke again in the 7.1 event hoping to keep that promise.",
