      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Silverwing: The Three Beasts of Tao Dou",
      "content": "The Eight Adepts were the Three Hermits of Guizang, the Two Sages of Lianshan and the Three Beasts of Tao Dou: the Lone Butterfly of the Crimson Flame, the Jade-Plumed Silverwing and the Gold-Eyed Celadon Mare (Zibai). To purify Tao Dou they used the Seven-and-Eight-Gates Array, which cost the Lone Butterfly her life.",
