      "key": [
        "swallow pattern",
        "Wind Reader's pavilion",
        "Silverwing's promise"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Silverwing",
        "Lan Junming"
      ],
      "comment": "Silverwing: The yearly meeting at Chenyu Vale",
      "content": "Each year the two met at a pavilion east of Teatree Slope. The Wind Reader drew a swallow shape on the water with a trace of her adeptal power so she could sense it. During the 7.1 event Lan Yan and the Traveler recreated the pattern, but Silverwing never came.",
