      "key": [
        "Ship of Theseus",
        "swallows of Liyue",
        "Zhongli's riddle"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Silverwing"
      ],
      "comment": "Silverwing: The swallows and the ship",
      "content": "Zhongli tells of a ship whose every plank was replaced until nothing original remained, and asks whether it is still the same ship. The swallows that return to Liyue each year are like that ship for Silverwing. A new mind may eventually arise in them, but it would not be the one the Wind Reader knew.",
